WEBVTT

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.070
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.840
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.180
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.020
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.720
With you guys

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
If we join forces

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.360
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:09.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.080
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.150
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.330
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.070
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.940
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.940
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:50.520
Someone once said...

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:54.760
There are many styles of hats...

00:01:55.420 --> 00:02:00.500
Particularly sun hats, worn 
by shiitake mushrooms...

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:04.300
Shiihatake Mushrooms!

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:15.640
There are anglerfish made of moist, 
mildly sweet red bean paste...

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:22.450
Red Beanglerfish Paste!

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:27.320
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:32.790
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:39.870
After sleeping for hundreds 
of years in the Gourmet World,

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:42.800
the Four-Beasts awoke and started 
heading for the Human World.

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:47.610
IGO declared a state of emergency.

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:51.840
Meanwhile, Komatsu was successful 
at cooking Bubble Fruit.

00:02:52.180 --> 00:02:56.080
It turned out to be an effective 
ingredient for all Four Kings.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:02.720
Have your cells level-upped?

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:07.960
The four of them are each entering the 
Human World from a different direction.

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:12.630
And so, by now IGO should have 
evacuated nearly all humans

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:17.870
to the 1,000 kilometer Central 
Sector in the Human World.

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:20.870
That's the final line of defense.

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:24.140
You'll be on the other side of that line.

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:26.480
Each of you will ambush one of the Beasts.

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:28.710
The Four Kings split up into four directions

00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:33.890
and quickly head off to battle their final 
training ingredient, the Four-Beasts.

00:03:35.490 --> 00:03:37.960
Who's going to get which Four-Beast?

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:39.960
That's somethin' to look 
forward to when we get there.

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:47.870
A Battle with the Existence of the Human Race 
on the Line! The Four-Beasts vs. the Four Kings!

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:13.090
Alright! Hurry, Terry!

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:59.070
Listen up! We can't let the 
Four Kings alone handle this!

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:03.300
Our army has developed plenty of 
countermeasures against the Four-Beasts!

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:06.640
We shall protect the Human World!

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:09.980
Now is the time to show them the might

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:12.950
of modern weapons created 
by human intelligence!

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:20.120
If you eat the delicious food prepared 
by the IGO Research Facility,

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:24.930
your anxiety will be eased 
and your fear allayed.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.760
Listen, everyone!

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:29.260
The Four-Beasts will definitely be stopped!

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.670
So just relax and be patient.

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:35.670
That was Chief Mansom of 
the IGO Research Facility.

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:39.410
We'll keep you up to date with further 
developments as they come in from IGO.

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:41.840
IGO is tryin' to make light of it,

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:44.540
but I get the feeling 
we're in real danger here.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:47.310
Me too. Will they really 
be able to protect us?

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:49.420
What are you sayin' now?!

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:52.050
You don't know jack, so 
quit flappin' your gums!

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:53.020
What'd you say?!

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:54.350
What?!

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:56.190
Everyone, you're nervous, aren't you?!

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:57.960
Hell, yeah, we're nervous!

00:05:57.960 --> 00:05:59.260
Of course!

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:00.790
You ain't the only one here!

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:03.330
Don't make these people more 
worried than they already are!

00:06:07.730 --> 00:06:09.000
Here, Chief.

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.940
Put these two together.

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:12.840
Yes, sir.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:17.340
All we're doing

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:20.510
is passing on announcements from IGO.

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:24.980
There's so much space here!

00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:26.620
Wait for me!

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:28.550
Let's go over there!

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.560
Admiral Jumpin! The Four-Beasts!

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:40.770
They're here?

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:42.930
Change the front line cameras!

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:45.270
Changing the front line cameras!

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:49.940
I-It's...

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:09.990
Fang King is approaching from the east!

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.960
The Baron Archipelago...

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:16.870
Never mind the ferocious Garara Gator,

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.970
there's no sign of any life...

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:23.170
Admiral! Look at this!

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:27.410
The sand dunes of the caves too...

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:29.710
That's terrible!

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:34.620
Admiral! We'll change the cameras!

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:37.250
Biotope 8, which contains Rainbow Fruit!

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:41.090
It's almost entirely destroyed and unknown 
if there are any Troll Kongs left!

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:45.460
We have Biotope 1 on camera!

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:48.500
We're getting reports that

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:51.000
a 1500-meter-long Regal Mammoth 
has been killed by a single blow!

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:53.570
What is this?!

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:55.240
It's too awful!

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.770
There's nothing!

00:07:57.670 --> 00:07:58.770
It's...

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:00.610
Is that really Biotope 1?!

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:03.850
W-What's this darkness?!

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:05.110
W-What is it?!

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:14.990
It's...

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:16.760
...a Beast King...

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:18.690
Fang King!

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:25.900
King Octopus Kong is moving in from the west!

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:28.640
The Wu Jungle is devastated!

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:32.840
And the Gourmet Pyramid has been destroyed!

00:08:37.110 --> 00:08:40.050
More bad news! Mount Turtle 
is moving in from the south!

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:44.450
I-Ice Hell has been crushed to pieces!

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:46.420
Invite Death is coming in from the north!

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.820
It's swimming down Death Falls!

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:01.330
Armies of the land, sea, and air!

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:03.670
Everyone, take your positions!

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:10.210
Prepare to fire laser cannons 
from the satellite battleship!

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:17.280
Mammoth tanks, which boast 100 meters 
in length and weigh 100,000 tons!

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:24.390
Our fighter jets, equipped with 
anti-giant Beast missiles!

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:28.960
Understood?! All personnel, 
advance without fear!

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:31.930
GT Robot operators, get in position!

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:33.970
This is not a drill!

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:37.870
It's a single battle with the existence 
of the human race in the balance!

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:39.870
All personnel, advance without fear!

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:45.010
I repeat! The existence of the human 
race rides on this single battle!

00:09:45.010 --> 00:09:47.950
All personnel, advance without fear!

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:54.820
Swallow a barrage of humanity's 
strongest firepower!

00:09:56.290 --> 00:09:58.120
Fire!

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:22.610
There hasn't been one bit of 
information for hours now!

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:25.480
Are the Four-Beasts really 
in the Human World?

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:27.320
Hey! Wait for me!

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:32.120
Let's drive!

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:34.560
We can't just wait around!

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:37.090
In these circumstances, we need 
to be reporting on the scene

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:39.360
to get as many grams of 
information as we can!

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:40.800
We're connected!

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:44.900
We're intercepting satellite 
footage that IGO is receiving.

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:21.700
Admiral! The Four-Beasts 
aren't even slowing down!

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:24.170
Gourmet World Beasts...

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:26.270
We can't even harm them?

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:52.370
Is this...

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:55.170
...the last of the human race?

00:11:56.870 --> 00:11:58.640
A-Admiral!

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:00.910
All of the Four-Beasts have stopped!

00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:04.310
The Four-Beasts have stopped moving...

00:12:04.310 --> 00:12:06.080
Yeah, they sure have...

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:10.920
Toriko and the others... The Four Kings...

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:15.620
Connect it to that!

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:17.290
Then everyone will be able to see it!

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:19.390
The moment humankind is saved!

00:12:44.650 --> 00:12:48.450
Back off quietly, humans.

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:51.420
And don't get cocky.

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:36.930
Look! Is that... one of the Four-Beasts?!

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:38.040
A Four-Beast!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.400
They really have come!

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:41.270
What's gonna happen to us?!

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:43.940
That's Toriko!

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:45.980
Toriko, one of the Four 
Kings Gourmet Hunters!

00:13:51.820 --> 00:13:54.020
That meddling woman again...!

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:56.550
It's about to start at last.

00:13:56.550 --> 00:13:58.190
The Four Kings versus the Four-Beasts!

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:07.760
Huh? I can't see its shadow of death.

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:10.200
At least not at this moment...

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:16.610
Disgusting!

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:18.470
Disgusting! Disgusting!

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:21.140
What is it?! Gross!

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:27.950
You stay outta this, Daruma Horse.

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:31.250
It's <i>my</i> playtime.

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:40.600
Alright. You wanna rumble?

00:14:42.460 --> 00:14:44.200
Well? Can you see them?

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:46.730
What is that?!

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:48.940
That's a Four-Beast...

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:51.240
It's like a demon!

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:53.840
Super Deodorant Smoke!

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:59.650
The distance between here and the 
Four-Beast is about five kilometers.

00:14:59.650 --> 00:15:02.650
Toriko judged that to 
be a safe distance away,

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:05.350
but just in case, I'm 
extinguishing our scent.

00:15:05.350 --> 00:15:07.890
Certainly, after getting 
a glimpse of that Beast,

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:10.420
I don't think even five 
kilometers away is safe.

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:14.160
Well, Toriko's going to do the measuring,

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:16.660
so we'll know for sure just 
how strong that Beast is.

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:28.680
Well, Terry, this guy's a tough one.

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:30.780
We better brace ourselves.

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.520
What's wrong, Terry?

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:38.650
Terry's looking away!

00:15:39.320 --> 00:15:43.890
That shows confidence, but 
exposes himself to danger!

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:47.990
And even more dangerous because 
it's stirring up Fang King's pride!

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:47.890
That is just a little test!

00:16:47.890 --> 00:16:51.560
30-fold Spiked Punch!

00:16:58.460 --> 00:16:59.860
How's that?!

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:49.750
I see.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:55.120
With your attacking power and endurance, 
you live up to the name of "King".

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:58.550
The Four-Beasts are said to be the 
strongest creatures in the Human World.

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:01.590
And I've heard your Capture Level is 100.

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:04.590
But let's just see about that...

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:09.100
Toriko put on the Measure Tongue!

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:12.270
So Toriko-san had one too.

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:16.500
But how does the device 
measure Capture Level?

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:20.040
It uses a Marking Chameleon's tongue.

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:23.140
The Marking Chameleon uses its special 
tongue to search for a prey's strengths

00:18:23.140 --> 00:18:26.510
and if the prey is weaker 
than itself, it'll eat it.

00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:29.020
The Measure Tongue uses that tongue

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:31.290
to convert Capture Level to 
a number and measures it.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:34.120
Its range is 50 meters.

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:36.790
Terry! Get as close to it as you can!

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:01.080
Measure Tongue!

00:19:18.060 --> 00:19:19.330
What?!

00:19:20.230 --> 00:19:22.770
What an incredible battle!

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:25.740
And the existence of the 
human race depends on it!

00:19:27.740 --> 00:19:31.310
The Capture Level of the Four-Beast 
my brother is fighting is coming in.

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:34.110
No way!

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:38.320
Capture Level 127...

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:43.690
We could be in big trouble unless we 
go after this guy seriously, Terry.

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:50.390
Even though you're a disgusting 
creature, your Capture Level is 132?

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:53.160
Still...

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:57.970
...you're disgusting!

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:09.910
You're a real cocky bastard, ya know?

00:20:36.310 --> 00:20:37.710
I'm beat.

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:41.680
Just how many antibodies does this guy have?

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:44.150
Capture Level 140...

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:06.230
I have been alone

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:13.640
Ever since that day

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:21.420
All I got was a definite history

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:28.020
But tomorrow is still, still, 
still just an uncertain dream

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:31.760
It’s like a tautology, logy

00:21:31.960 --> 00:21:35.200
This is a tautology, logy

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:38.970
A dream is still a dream

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:42.570
Not gonna wake up, logy, logy

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:46.370
Right now, we’re lookin’ at

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:49.910
What it is we're lookin' at

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:57.420
The thing we’re lookin’ 
at ain’t no illusion

00:22:00.850 --> 00:22:03.960
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:08.630
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:16.540
Hiding Level 12

00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:11.800
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 12.

00:22:11.800 --> 00:22:13.870
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:22:13.870 --> 00:22:16.270
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:19.370 --> 00:22:22.140
I want to eat a heaping helping of that too!

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:25.980
I mean, where could Yun be?!

00:22:27.680 --> 00:22:28.650
Yun is...

00:22:29.050 --> 00:22:30.120
...right here!

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:34.290
How was it?

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:37.920
With all the ice cream, maybe it 
was kind of <i>icy</i> to figure out?

00:22:39.390 --> 00:22:41.190
<i>Icy</i> to figure out...

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:43.090
With all the ice cream...

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:46.670
Cold...

00:22:47.930 --> 00:22:49.900
Well, on to the next segment!

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:55.240
Techniques explosively collide! Go, Four Kings!

00:22:55.570 --> 00:22:57.420
This is their upgraded power!

00:22:57.920 --> 00:23:01.650
Toriko, Coco, Sunny, Zebra! The Four Kings' Storming Onslaught!

00:23:02.170 --> 00:23:03.790
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
